Source: Department of State, Conference Files: Lot 64 D 560, CF 1169. Secret;
                    Limit Distribution. Drafted by McBride
                    on December 16. The meeting was held at the Hotel Matignon.

Dulles told Couve de Murville on December 17 the main points of his
                    conversation with de Gaulle. (USDel/MC/22;
                    Department of State, Conference Files: Lot 64 D 560, CF 1169)
